SECTION B: COUNTERFACTUAL ACTION SENSITIVITY (per-game action range)
============================================================
eval_JEPA_new.py tests all 17 offsets mod 18 regardless of game. For a
Breakout sequence (4 valid actions) that means 14 of 17 'wrong' actions
were never valid for Breakout at all -- borrowed embedding rows trained on
other games entirely (D2). This restricts wrong-action sampling to each
sequence's own game's valid action count.

  correct-action similarity      : 0.9393
  avg wrong-action similarity     : 0.9392  (avg 11.0 valid alternatives tested per sample, range 1-17)
  max disruption (worst action)   : 0.9386
  avg action delta                : +0.0001
  max action delta                : +0.0007
  -> FAIL: no action sensitivity once cross-game action-index aliasing is removed.

