SUMMARY
============================================================
This is a diagnostic report, not a pass/fail gate. Read Sections D and E
first: if attention mass on the action token is near-uniform AND the
representation's effective rank / per-dim std is collapsed, the high
cosine similarities in Sections A-C are likely an artifact of a degenerate
embedding space rather than evidence of a working world model.

